                    Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d327-f2" n="2" xml:id="d327-f2-content">
                <p> Sayre indicated that President Johnson disapproved the action on March 26.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d327-f3" n="3" xml:id="d327-f3-content">
                <p>A handwritten note at the end of the memorandum reads: “This is Tom Mannʼs
                    recommendation.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
